{
  "answer_text": "The papers report the following evaluation metrics: fact-level accuracy, ROUGE-L, hallucination rate, answer accuracy, latency, and BLEU. Specifically, [S009] reports fact-level accuracy and ROUGE-L [S009, 0-1270]. [S011] reports fact-level accuracy [S011, 0-1086]. [S003] reports fact-level accuracy (FLA) [S003, 2532-3792]. [S004] reports answer accuracy, latency, and BLEU [S004, 2474-3765]. [S001] reports hallucination rate [S001, 0-1023]. [S007] reports the share of answers containing unsupported statements, which is a measure of hallucination [S007, 1427-2635]. [S012] reports a metric for unsupported statements (hallucination) [S012, 2754-3680].",
